issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells.\n\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}","text":"Like most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells."},{"heading":"Spells Utilized","level":2,"wikitext":"*[[Augerfrost]]\n*[[Raypulse]]\n*[[Strikemode]] ([[TCG:SAS-125|TCG]])\n\n{{col-2}}","text":"• Augerfrost\n• Raypulse\n• Strikemode (TCG)"},{"heading":"Titans Bonded","level":2,"wikitext":"* [[Jokoul]]\n* [[Redcap]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","text":"• Jokoul\n• Redcap"}],"full_text":"Unnamed Suit 011 is a Suit working for the Organization, previously commanded by DeFoe as one of the recruits stationed in Paris, France. He possesses a prominent scar in the shape of a lightning bolt below his left eye.\n\nHistory\n\nThis Suit was recruited by DeFoe for additional assistance in the attempt to secure the legendary Ring of Arc. Within the Paris Catacombs, this Suit caught Zhalia Moon impersonating the unnamed Suit 010. He later fought against Zhalia with his Redcap Titan. [Divide and Conquer]\n\nAbilities\n\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells.\n\nSpells Utilized\n\n• Augerfrost\n• Raypulse\n• Strikemode (TCG)\n\nTitans Bonded\n\n• Jokoul\n• Redcap","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox character\n| image  = File:Unnamed Suit 011.png\n| group  = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br>[[Suits]]\n| base   = [[Paris, France]]\n| gender = Male\n| hair   = Brown\n| eyes   = \n| first  = \"[[Divide and Conquer]]\"\n}}\n'''Unnamed Suit 011''' is a [[Suit]] working for [[the Organization]], previously commanded by [[DeFoe]] as one of the recruits stationed in [[Paris, France]]. He possesses a prominent scar in the shape of a lightning bolt below his left eye.\n\n== History ==\nThis Suit was recruited by [[DeFoe]] for additional assistance in the attempt to secure the legendary [[Ring of Arc]]. Within the [[Paris Catacombs]], this Suit caught [[Zhalia Moon]] impersonating the [[unnamed Suit 010]]. He later fought against Zhalia with his [[Redcap]] Titan. {{Source|Divide and Conquer}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells.\n\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}\n== Spells Utilized ==\n*[[Augerfrost]]\n*[[Raypulse]]\n*[[Strikemode]] ([[TCG:SAS-125|TCG]])\n\n{{col-2}}\n== Titans Bonded ==\n* [[Jokoul]]\n* [[Redcap]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:9034","status":"resolved","target_title":"Paris, France","label":"Paris, France","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Paris%2C_France","href":"#/categories?name=Paris%2C%20France"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2722","status":"resolved","target_title":"Divide and Conquer","label":"Divide and Conquer","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Divide_and_Conquer","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2722"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suit","label":"Suit","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suit","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"the Organization","label":"the Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/the_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2048","status":"resolved","target_title":"DeFoe","label":"DeFoe","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/DeFoe"